    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d159">

                <pb facs="0326" n="230" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg230"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Conger.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-10-10"><hi rendition="#italic">October 10,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Yours of 9th received. <hi rendition="#italic">Boston</hi> and <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Petrel</hi> with marine guards left Manila for Taku
                    October 4. Should arrive October 14. Order guards to Peking only in case of
                    necessity.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
